#: scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ea4a9f1afb2f7cc74698ca6a71db7eef689e6e334bdfbcfc52973c53633acf2
#. default-sha256: 55815e8e58fb07e0f9c83036ac0c853d11d8c99411540eb7a512d7f096eda1e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After being pierced by Didier’s blade,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I found myself looking down upon my own "
"corpse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……장남 디디에의 검에 목숨을 잃은 나는……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫정신이 드니, ⟪k:3⟫죽은 내 모습을 보고 있었"
"다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae40b7dbfde7d9b134cbe05ae44c7d20143c515f286b9afd3752227c1979a0ce
#. default-sha256: dff0e6be9f7419e1939598e6e9e599e92c19c1ae1d96f11e1bf5b66c5bb130d9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched as my eldest brother dragged me to the place of my crucifixion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫형의 손으로 ⟪k:2⟫책형장으로 끌려가는 그 모습을……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내 눈으로…… 보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31bcdc96a3671fd377aa106cf855e010fdffa4ec0d51c40bd12d3471ee25a801
#. default-sha256: 620b8109ea9101f7d0cb534371adf7697e71864ef01b8e02b2cf0f98bbe9a548
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The knights!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫기사님!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d83eaffb6925972df3ae1fb6f600ef16a0269f9a086f511f34cc1967a72dd76
#. default-sha256: b61a4431383c90e0270c75caa176d7f1d79ab3cbb6cd08908707b8401ef68463
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men who had come to ransack the mansion were standing there, staring at my body in awe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예전에 내 저택에 쳐들어온 자들이……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫황홀한 표정으로 ⟪k:3⟫내 시체를 보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfb1111330a9692eb1d4f64f8abc5ad179b93ba7185f0e70637f9d006246d496
#. default-sha256: 76f84408902454e970ad7573e97be7992e97cb4ecb710bddd7cb20cfab59a9ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, the Lord’s judgment has been delivered unto the witch of the cursed mansion by His holy "
"servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아아……. ⟪k:1⟫이게 주님의 뜻이야. ⟪k:2⟫그 저주받은 저택에 살던 마녀를 ⟪k:3⟫기사님들께서 마침"
"내 심판하셨어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e7423c5a6fbf3e3af4f5316fc5803dbb48616a53a9247fb9dd829ab476a8d60
#. default-sha256: c3edeb2fdfaa257efeeab5a0631fc7f9ad0a82bb6c9f89b505cbad3f71d7cdab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We have assembled all the tools you need to execute your divine mission. ⟪k:1⟫A cross, "
"befitting of such a heinous sinner!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫기사님. ⟪k:2⟫준비는 다 됐습니다. ⟪k:3⟫저주받은 마녀에게 잘 맞는 십자가가 ⟪k:4⟫여기 "
"있죠!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee485c0ce34e9755eaa5c533373590b8abaf1defbc145872d2c31fe835b1242a
#. default-sha256: fb3eb081f2596cbed337cd9c304e10818bccaf79e99e3707b505362af86ab65a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That witch threatened to curse us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sullied our pure ears with its blasphemy!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 마녀는 저희에게 저주를 뿌리려 했습니다!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫무고한 저희에게 ⟪k:3⟫저주를 토했단 말입니"
"다!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa226a914fb31a9206becf2c62043a33f00eca59580b15376536add08b3db16b
#. default-sha256: c7b6f4483cb0eb94d85d172fcdb9de4a3bfab8154723c53d149834b6d707fd20
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had done no such thing...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hadn’t cursed anyone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had merely been "
"defending myself..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 아무 짓도 안 했다……. ⟪k:1⟫아무도 저주한 적이 없다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 ⟪k:4⟫내 몸을 지키려 한 "
"거였다……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67153dcfd2dee8f78959886fbeea28abc0996cb9554394823eda6889f3d153a7
#. default-sha256: 4528f6b2f324e233f7c7c39a832589e28b907a63a524192a96f60e6821bdc8ae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had been armed and outnumbered me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so I had said what was necessary to chase "
"them off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫무기를 든 민중에게서 ⟪k:1⟫내 몸을 지키려고……,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 목적으로만 ⟪k:4⟫말을 한 거였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9fbb1a463593a2aab30edae511b74eaa8212a366636f82a9c56a305e09b883f
#. default-sha256: 1e0f5fc484cf8631947cd1519e84c5b7c2cd92ab720b4e19334da11490e82cd1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our poor harvest and our suffering at the hands of the greedy lord were all the work of the "
"witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫저희가 영주에 폭정에 고통받은 것도――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫최근 부쩍 심해진 흉작도! ⟪k:4⟫다 마녀 "
"짓입니다!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8c7077772d88897f03e2b82832de082ca45b871bf6bbf1bf6cc4fff8f47a2b9
#. default-sha256: 014337bde9c06eb4503f10d502144506bb389d2adba720b826a3945befb4abcc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I prayed. ⟪k:1⟫I asked God to grant me the smallest of miracles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫내 시체를 업은 형에게…… 간청할 수밖에 없었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫부디 신이여, ⟪k:4⟫작은 기"
"적이어도 되니――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a03fa1629762eafea1ee0d6057c9e8482973a7fc458a199f7626aacea0cd7a33
#. default-sha256: ee8906071fdb7be83d869f52247a32804f9b0ed058416b686ec6f3c289898456
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To let my voice reach my brother, who carried my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 목소리를 ⟪k:1⟫형에게 닿게 해 달라…… 기도했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eb375183e90c1703ed0194a64741e6769b8e6a275245a4f03f353bc5e228d01
#. default-sha256: aac272ca79191a7f315edfded983b0f6275e84dfa9a9bfe499ab63c7cd245496
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know me better than that...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know I’ve done nothing wrong..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫형님……, ⟪k:1⟫당신이라면 ⟪k:2⟫아실 것 아닙니까…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제가 아무런 죄도 저지르지 않았단 사"
"실을……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2c7313fd950c62f96d29f5fa7540f1782a6fed4d7e7ab1f5000b66fc085ea6b
#. default-sha256: 76550da450cd8d899162cda4710382f8e704ebff335691425e16af5c3fb58300
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those men smirking at the sight of my body...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they’re the ones putting the blame "
"for their sins on me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 시체를 보며 웃는 저 자들이야말로 ⟪k:1⟫예전에 죄를 저질러――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 누명을 제게 씌운단 "
"것을……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9b6dc6d3b2c755037acd473a9f0ef53eb4cf3e0597ff0dcef62e731afaeb9f5
#. default-sha256: 2b6da71c4e0bf83b505635658bd3c87a9ecc04d71f54dbdd5cc9b342b3c9f631
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫ can give me a respectable burial..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신만이라도 저를 알아 주시고, ⟪k:1⟫양지바른 곳에 묻어 주십시오……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a79f42f780eba351face2e0445409a5819e153c232e8701bbb044c4cfa613cce
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6834ad17ff1b971b3b9926704a282c171f71b508d7c274e61f7d54b0a870898
#. default-sha256: 90dcc8948b65f37f4d35008fdc13ffe779261e3b3655b989d2e1b2dac0102d30
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you say nothing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어째서 ⟪k:1⟫그 남자에게서――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce03a9406d24120fa9cdbd12be28d6476f0770f767230c67a8b834daa9aa62fd
#. default-sha256: fdfe4df0ad5fa011e7e7d8c18003c872dc6758d36ff2acda9568112c5bc5b845
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you accept the tools this man presents you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저를 벌하는 ⟪k:1⟫도구를 받아――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf51f40184ec35894f36c2a7fc1ec0d83c881d0aa994317d486a8f279f856fc8
#. default-sha256: 84a4bc7b33c1e4ff1bba0cd01d6b2fc78b6762709180186f640737bf5fc7b82a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫tools meant to punish me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무 말도 않고 끄덕이십니까……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d422e4e05eeda418fcc435e12a9ae590327f11fa8ffb647fa8e44a2a9aac178
#. default-sha256: 58c87d28d7abe9c08e29b1ea323aba06e2f0f1d09305cdd29e4ef3a162ad861d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tell me, Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어째섭니까, ⟪k:1⟫형님……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c63da066a93d386a1365f33ef647f2014489d128ece97478946bcd020bc2ca6
#. default-sha256: 2fe28c6a4c4bb954c3ac9738f20a9efab50a0eaafcffb3e4b8d3c02e7850b5ef
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫십자가에!!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21c2f3e88e7f277bc2c6c469d1f2ac45af864b1cf56ef3a8b4d22a3092519f7d
#. default-sha256: 10e34e72ea645b1d64c70376e56c49d6fc2332b00bc7e64fb90bbbab7a82f769
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Please, anything but that... ⟪k:1⟫I’m begging you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫don’t expose me to these "
"people..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제발, ⟪k:1⟫그것만큼은……, ⟪k:2⟫그것만큼은 하지 마십시오…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제 육체를 ⟪k:5⟫민중 앞에 "
"노출시키는 것만큼은――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c344d52273df4ae56d5e21fc5fc854fb4f93c03614376654c7e1e71d533547ef
#. default-sha256: cf7da8eb57aefc1202230cc980e79bfd824d9974f1ebf8fe978cacd882af5631
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t expose my body, Didier!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제발 그러지 마십시오, ⟪k:1⟫형님……!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca95641d750b04e58642bae05e22cf4446127b1e81d5769de61a73c5481c78d8
#. default-sha256: 04a3ab433fe8656826d9d93d5d7648970fcd486f5f310f8d0f1bd89adce5ab7d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m begging you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그것만큼은, ⟪k:1⟫제발……!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2ba051cfb8ed0b16fdcc19e7c7cc1af508e7ce94fc3dd89ca1b5e4f73a60250
#. default-sha256: bc282826275dbc72ec80e5bab27f6a8e7174730d4dfe38aec3e35e490bc73fc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But of course, my voice had no way of reaching him,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and he proceeded to remove my "
"clothing, piece by piece,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫내 목소리는 당연히 ⟪k:2⟫형에게 닿지 않았으며――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫형은 담담하게 내 옷을 벗"
